{"id": "EUVD-2026-80042", "enisaUuid": "55b9e5c6-6f53-3ac6-87f4-33adadf7d993", "description": "Netcore NR255-V version 1.5.130703 contains an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the mtd_write pre-flash validation routine triggered by short firmware uploads. Attackers can upload a truncated firmware image via put_file_cgi.c to trigger out-of-bounds reads across main.c, check_image_uuid.c, and oemMD5Update.c.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T21:58:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-16T19:32:33", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/draw-ctf/netcore-router-public-refs/blob/main/2026.08.19-netcore-nr255v-firmware-upload-oob.md", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/netcore-nr255-v-1.5.130703-out-of-bounds-read-in-mtd-write-firmware-upload-validation"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6pww-6jhw-38g6", "CVE-2026-76870"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.4, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4265d93a-dab3-3c49-8e5a-60df580a1c74", "product": {"name": "NR255-V", "vendor": {"name": "Netcore"}}, "product_version": "1.5.130703"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b03201f3-3dc2-3628-8788-d6d59cc65bc6", "vendor": {"name": "Netcore"}}], "isExploited": false}